    "PREDVIDEVANJE, PREPOZNANJE IN OCENA TVEGANJA ZA KRIMINALNO DEJANJE TER UVEDBA UKREPOV ZA ODSTRANITVEV TVEGANJA"@sl,
    "THE ANTICIPATION, RECOGNITION, AND APPRAISAL OF A CRIME RISK, AND THE INITIATION OF ACTION TO REMOVE OR ELIMINATE THAT RISK"@en;
